WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:35.400


00:00:37.679 --> 00:00:38.640
Sure, we'll join

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.000
It's just two drinks

00:00:47.359 --> 00:00:49.280
It's on me, drink as much as you want

00:00:53.079 --> 00:00:55.240
Why do you care so much about your fiancée?

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:57.079
The reporters are over there

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.719
We're just business partners

00:01:21.439 --> 00:01:22.680
Cut the tricks

00:01:36.239 --> 00:01:37.439
Siqi, this one's for you

00:01:38.799 --> 00:01:40.719
Thanks for making our love possible

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.000
She can't drink anymore

00:01:49.319 --> 00:01:49.959
She can't hold her liquor

00:01:53.319 --> 00:01:53.879
I'll take it

00:02:10.159 --> 00:02:11.840
This invisible war

00:02:12.479 --> 00:02:13.639
is really something

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:21.960
Jiang Lai really has some tricks up her sleeve

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.199
She clearly seduced Young Master Sheng first

00:02:24.599 --> 00:02:25.879
yet she made Lin Siqi

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:27.759
look like the one who cheated first

00:02:28.039 --> 00:02:29.159
Why do you care so much?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.400
Make sure to write a good article

00:02:30.639 --> 00:02:31.560
Stick to one core message

00:02:31.759 --> 00:02:33.240
Jiang Lai is the sweet angel

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.280
comforting the heartbroken rich heir

00:02:36.479 --> 00:02:37.759
How about I title it like this?

00:02:38.479 --> 00:02:41.400
Lin Siqi Cheats with Poor Country Boy

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.280
Sheng Yuanzhou Struggles to Heal from Heartbreak

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:45.479
Young Master Sheng

00:02:47.599 --> 00:02:48.639
Who told you to write that?

00:02:49.479 --> 00:02:50.120
Miss Jiang

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:51.319
Delete it and rewrite it

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:55.080
Lin Siqi's name can't appear at all

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:55.639
Did you hear me?

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:56.759
Yes

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:04.680
That Sheng heir is such a simp

00:03:05.639 --> 00:03:06.680
He's already been cuckolded

00:03:07.159 --> 00:03:08.560
and he's still protecting Lin Siqi

00:03:16.319 --> 00:03:16.759
Jiang Lai

00:03:21.039 --> 00:03:21.840
What are you doing?

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:23.800
Let me tell you

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:25.800
whatever is between us

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:27.560
leave Siqi out of it

00:03:30.879 --> 00:03:31.599
Feeling upset?

00:03:32.039 --> 00:03:33.840
If Siqi gets hurt at all

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:36.400
you'll never step foot in the Sheng house again

00:03:41.719 --> 00:03:43.199
Then you don't want the Key of Fate?

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.080
You won't be Sheng Yuanzhou anymore?

00:03:54.879 --> 00:03:55.800
Let me tell you

00:03:55.919 --> 00:03:57.560
I won't take the blame of being The other woman

00:03:57.919 --> 00:03:59.599
After all, in your engagement

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.240
the one who betrayed you was Lin Siqi

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.360
I just want what's fair

00:04:12.039 --> 00:04:12.759
What?

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.000
Our business

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:17.639
isn't finished yet

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:33.959
Well?

00:04:40.639 --> 00:04:41.680
It's just acting

00:04:42.319 --> 00:04:43.279
Why so dedicated?

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:45.959
What do you think?

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.639
Didn't you have the paparazzi delete

00:04:48.639 --> 00:04:49.639
all of Lin Siqi's photos?

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.439
Aren't you playing the heartless jerk?

00:04:52.759 --> 00:04:54.000
Then I'll play along

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:56.839
Fine

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.000
Here comes the main event

00:05:06.399 --> 00:05:06.959
Shoot it, shoot it!

00:05:06.959 --> 00:05:07.519
Shoot, shoot!

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:17.720
Why'd he close the curtains?

00:05:18.279 --> 00:05:19.160
Must be premium content

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.160
What's going on?

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.160
Closing the curtains this early?

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.319
How are reporters supposed to get shots?

00:05:24.639 --> 00:05:25.800
We've got enough photos already

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:26.959
No need to shoot more

00:05:31.839 --> 00:05:33.480
I don't mind making it real

00:05:37.279 --> 00:05:40.160
Jiang Lai, you know better than anyone

00:05:40.879 --> 00:05:42.319
I'm Zhang Xiaobei

00:05:43.199 --> 00:05:44.240
I know

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:47.279
The Sheng family's money, and you

00:05:48.079 --> 00:05:49.040
I want it all

00:05:50.319 --> 00:05:51.199
Sorry

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.439
I don't care

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.759
Are you saving yourself for Lin Siqi?

00:05:57.319 --> 00:05:58.199
What's it to you?

00:05:58.439 --> 00:05:59.720
Even if you're hopelessly devoted

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.480
in Lin Siqi's eyes

00:06:01.879 --> 00:06:03.240
you'll always be Sheng Yuanzhou

00:06:03.839 --> 00:06:04.879
And Sheng Yuanzhou

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.680
will always be her beloved Zhang Xiaobei

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.839
Sure, you can save yourself for her

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:13.120
but she might not stay faithful to you

00:06:15.759 --> 00:06:16.839
What the hell do you mean?

00:06:21.439 --> 00:06:22.560
I mean

00:06:23.839 --> 00:06:25.839
I didn't just invite the two of them

00:06:25.839 --> 00:06:27.240
to dinner by the beach

00:06:28.199 --> 00:06:29.199
What else did you do?

00:06:30.959 --> 00:06:31.720
Worried?

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.720
They're the real couple now

00:06:34.079 --> 00:06:36.759
Anything they do is perfectly reasonable, isn't it?

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:39.959
Speak

00:06:40.279 --> 00:06:41.759
My patience has limits

00:06:42.639 --> 00:06:43.000
Tell me

00:06:43.279 --> 00:06:44.120
Room 410

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.360
I booked them a honeymoon suite

00:06:51.639 --> 00:06:53.519
The number you dialed is powered off

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:07.519
We...

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:10.680
They must've made a mistake

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.199
I'll call the front desk right now

00:07:23.639 --> 00:07:24.279
Help me

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.839
You can't fight those in power

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.839
You need some backbone

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:31.240
How am I supposed to have backbone?

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:39.040
What's done is done

00:07:39.519 --> 00:07:41.399
Your dad won't be able to oppose it then

00:07:56.279 --> 00:07:57.680
No, don't

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.240
Don't you come any closer

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.560
I won, you promised

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:03.680
No, no, no!

00:08:05.279 --> 00:08:05.680
Open up!

00:08:06.879 --> 00:08:07.519
Open up!

00:08:09.279 --> 00:08:10.519
Open up! Open up!

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:16.959
Sheng Yuanzhou

00:08:17.879 --> 00:08:18.600
What are you doing here?

00:08:24.079 --> 00:08:24.879
You animal!

00:08:24.879 --> 00:08:26.639
Sheng Yuanzhou, what are you doing?

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:34.960
I...

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:36.200
Let go of me!

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:37.399
Are you out of your mind?

00:08:37.799 --> 00:08:38.679
Barging in here just to start trouble

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:40.799
What, you two playing chess?

00:08:40.799 --> 00:08:41.759
Don't play dumb with me

00:08:42.039 --> 00:08:42.919
Just spit it out

00:08:43.519 --> 00:08:44.639
It's nothing, I just...

00:08:44.639 --> 00:08:46.080
If it's nothing, then leave

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.080
Actually, I

00:08:47.559 --> 00:08:49.639
wanted to invite you both for a drink

00:08:49.759 --> 00:08:50.279
No

00:08:50.559 --> 00:08:52.159
Come on, it's rare for us to be here

00:08:52.399 --> 00:08:52.919
Come on, let's go

00:08:53.159 --> 00:08:54.120
Hurry up and get out, you hear me?

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:54.879
Let's go

00:08:54.879 --> 00:08:55.559
Why are you pushing me?

00:08:55.559 --> 00:08:56.600
I heard New Pants is playing today

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.480
having a small live show

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:58.480
New Pants

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:02.919
Sure

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:19.879
How is it?

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:20.919
Nice atmosphere, right?

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:22.360
Where's the band you mentioned?

00:09:26.519 --> 00:09:27.759
Maybe I misheard.

00:09:27.759 --> 00:09:28.799
You lied to us, didn't you?

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:30.480
I didn't lie to you.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.320
All right, don't be mad.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:34.200
Worst case, dinner's on me.

00:09:34.919 --> 00:09:36.480
Come on, sit, sit.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:38.440
You too, sit down. Come on.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:45.480
Give me a second.

00:09:58.399 --> 00:09:59.759
I honestly think this place

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.080
has a pretty great vibe.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.320
So I wanted to invite you to check it out.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:03.519
So, not bad, right?

00:10:14.279 --> 00:10:15.320
This next song,

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.960
I'd like to dedicate to my girlfriend,

00:10:17.679 --> 00:10:18.480
Lin Siqi.

00:10:20.919 --> 00:10:22.639
Thank you for always staying by my side,

00:10:23.559 --> 00:10:24.679
and for treasuring

00:10:26.759 --> 00:10:27.679
someone who isn't all that great.

00:10:41.639 --> 00:10:42.279
Siqi.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.039
Do you like him?

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:47.720
Who?

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:49.399
The guy singing up there.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:53.799
Of course.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:55.759
Then...

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:58.080
Do you like him, or Zhang Xiaobei?

00:11:02.919 --> 00:11:04.159
Isn't he Zhang Xiaobei?

00:11:06.799 --> 00:11:07.600
I mean...

00:11:08.519 --> 00:11:09.799
If he weren't Zhang Xiaobei,

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.159
would you still like him?

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.039
Not Zhang Xiaobei?

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:32.759
Why does Sheng Yuanzhou care so much about me?

00:11:40.159 --> 00:11:40.879
I'll peel the shrimp for you.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:42.720
No.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:43.279
Just wait.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:44.240
I mean...

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:45.559
Siqi can't eat seafood.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:55.480
What if...

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.080
I mean, just what if.

00:11:57.559 --> 00:11:58.039
This guy...

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.360
He's like the Zhang Xiaobei you remember,

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:02.080
but he also doesn't quite seem like

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.120
the Zhang Xiaobei from your memories.

00:12:03.639 --> 00:12:04.080
You...

00:12:05.519 --> 00:12:06.639
Would you be able to tell the difference?

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.200
I would.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.639
You're that confident?

00:12:15.639 --> 00:12:16.320
I...

00:12:17.559 --> 00:12:18.200
I definitely...

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.399
could spot him

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:21.919
in a crowd for sure.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:45.600
I...

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:57.799
No...

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:00.480
I didn't see anything.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:01.600
Sorry to interrupt.

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:03.480
You misunderstood, Siqi.

00:14:05.519 --> 00:14:06.039
Siqi!

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:22.600
Don't come any closer.

00:14:24.559 --> 00:14:25.480
What happened yesterday was a misunderstanding.

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.399
Don't take it to heart.

00:14:28.799 --> 00:14:30.120
Can't you just stay away from me?

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:32.879
Even if you asked, I wouldn't come close.

00:14:32.879 --> 00:14:33.720
Good.

00:14:34.399 --> 00:14:36.120
From now on, we go our separate ways.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:43.960
Let's go, let's go.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:46.559
And one more thing.

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.399
About us sleeping in the same bed yesterday...

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:51.559
Don't tell anyone.

00:14:54.679 --> 00:14:55.399
You too.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:12.679
Sheng Yuanzhou.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.679
After we get back this time,

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.799
I'll make it clear to my dad that I'm calling off the engagement.

00:15:19.559 --> 00:15:20.440
Since I was little,

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.600
I grew up with Jiang Lai.

00:15:23.759 --> 00:15:25.679
It's the first time I've seen her care so much about someone.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:27.080
She...

00:15:27.759 --> 00:15:29.320
She just has a tough exterior, soft heart.

00:15:30.159 --> 00:15:32.960
She always speaks with sarcasm and provocation,

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.279
but it's really to hide her true feelings.

00:15:36.879 --> 00:15:38.080
She's afraid of getting hurt.

00:15:41.679 --> 00:15:43.600
So from now on, you need to be more patient with her.

00:15:46.759 --> 00:15:47.440
Also...

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.639
About you getting a room with Zhu Yutong,

00:15:49.639 --> 00:15:50.600
I won't say a word.

00:15:51.519 --> 00:15:53.000
But I hope you won't do that again.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:54.360
All right.

00:15:55.799 --> 00:15:56.320
Let's go.

00:15:58.879 --> 00:15:59.320
Bye.

00:16:00.399 --> 00:16:02.120
Bye. Have a safe trip.

00:16:12.799 --> 00:16:14.360
Siqi, wait for me.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.679
I'll be back by your side soon.

00:16:18.159 --> 00:16:18.799
Xiaobei.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:23.399
I already called a car for myself.

00:16:23.799 --> 00:16:24.679
You can go back first.

00:16:25.799 --> 00:16:26.960
I'll take a cab and see you home.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:27.840
No need.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.600
A lot's happened lately.

00:16:31.919 --> 00:16:33.120
I want some time alone to think.